  "snapshot_source": "enumerated 2026-04-21 from 7 Bundesliga IDSSE match event XMLs in /Volumes/soccer_analytics/bronze/libs/idsse_data via 2-level XML walk (Event -> first-child -> nested-child -> great-grand-child attrs). Replaces the 1-level snapshot at /tmp/dfl_enum_full.txt.",
  "notes": [
    "event_level_attrs live on the <Event> element itself.",
    "first_child_types: tag names of <Event>'s first child element; exactly one per Event. `attrs` is the union of XML attributes observed across all 7 matches.",
    "nested_children: attrs on nested elements inside a first-child. 2-level enum captures SuccessfulShot/SavedShot/ShotWide/ShotWoodWork/BlockedShot/OtherShot attrs (ShotAtGoal nested) and FaultExecution/FairPlay/Play attrs (ThrowIn nested).",
    "A tag may have multiple parents (e.g. Play is nested under CornerKick/FreeKick/GoalKick/KickOff/ThrowIn AND exists as a top-level first-child). The parser handles this via _NESTED_PREFIX_MAP \u2014 Play's nested attrs reuse the `play_*` prefix."
